(7728322, 1272455, 637, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I wish it had been cropped so that the bird and its perch were a little more prominent.</td>', 'Great capture, I wish it had been cropped so that the bird and its perch were a little more prominent.', '2022-08-21 18:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728323, 1272445, 637, '<td valign="top">Distinctive capture under the circumstances, yet i don''t think it emerges as an incredible photo.</td>', 'Distinctive capture under the circumstances, yet i don''t think it emerges as an incredible photo.', '2022-08-21 18:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728324, 1272427, 637, '<td valign="top">Spectacular colors, love the composition and the distinctive coloring</td>', 'Spectacular colors, love the composition and the distinctive coloring', '2022-08-21 18:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728325, 1272452, 637, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail, fascinating perspective.  How would it have looked in portrait mode, with more of the building captured, still retaining some of the background?</td>', 'Wonderful detail, fascinating perspective.  How would it have looked in portrait mode, with more of the building captured, still retaining some of the background?', '2022-08-21 18:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728326, 1272438, 637, '<td valign="top">Beyond my skill level, can''t really figure it out but i Like it.  So i won''t sully it with a vote.</td>', 'Beyond my skill level, can''t really figure it out but i Like it.  So i won''t sully it with a vote.', '2022-08-21 18:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728327, 1272430, 637, '<td valign="top">Love the emptiness of this plaza.  Like the symmetry of the composition and the geometry, especially in the foreground.  My eye is pulled to the area just beyond the pool.  Is that what you intended as your subject?</td>', 'Love the emptiness of this plaza.  Like the symmetry of the composition and the geometry, especially in the foreground.  My eye is pulled to the area just beyond the pool.  Is that what you intended as your subject?', '2022-08-21 18:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728328, 1272434, 637, '<td valign="top">Wish the doorway exposure weren''t blown out... i like it very much otherwise, particularly the textures of all the artifacts and the walls.</td>', 'Wish the doorway exposure weren''t blown out... i like it very much otherwise, particularly the textures of all the artifacts and the walls.', '2022-08-21 18:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728329, 1272431, 637, '<td valign="top">What''s your subject?  The bird is kinda too small to be your subject, no?  Beautiful capture.  When I see someone else''s photo like this I can see why I''m dinged for photographing beautiful scenes but not really telling the viewer where he/she should be looking.</td>', 'What''s your subject?  The bird is kinda too small to be your subject, no?  Beautiful capture.  When I see someone else''s photo like this I can see why I''m dinged for photographing beautiful scenes but not really telling the viewer where he/she should be looking.', '2022-08-21 18:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728330, 1272443, 637, '<td valign="top">Is the sunset your subject?  Lovely coloring... interesting foreground.</td>', 'Is the sunset your subject?  Lovely coloring... interesting foreground.', '2022-08-21 18:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728436, 1272438, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfectly spherical and nicely done!  I''ve tried this - no idea how to do it so well!</td>', 'Perfectly spherical and nicely done!  I''ve tried this - no idea how to do it so well!', '2022-08-22 18:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
