(7728714, 1272191, 123833, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sjgleah:</b></div><hr/><i> Troubled by the composition or perhaps the crop.   If the bridge is the subject I''d look for it to be more prominent. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Sorry about the title ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by sjgleah: Troubled by the composition or perhaps the crop.   If the bridge is the subject I''d look for it to be more prominent.  Sorry about the title ;)', '2022-08-26 11:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7728715, 1272191, 123833, '<td valign="top">I cannot update details of the image so I have to comment on this image. My love for traditional photography has been totally overtaken by my new passion for virtual photography. Amazing how much is possible in 3D, I can play for hours with lights, arrangements, ideas. I can let my imagination go in any direction and create an image for it! WOW!<br/> <br/>Anyway, if ever a true FREE study with no rules appears on the DPC I will be back, otherwise I will just check from time to time what you are all up to :)</td>', 'I cannot update details of the image so I have to comment on this image. My love for traditional photography has been totally overtaken by my new passion for virtual photography. Amazing how much is possible in 3D, I can play for hours with lights, arrangements, ideas. I can let my imagination go in any direction and create an image for it! WOW! Anyway, if ever a true FREE study with no rules appears on the DPC I will be back, otherwise I will just check from time to time what you are all up to :)', '2022-08-26 11:25:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7728722, 1272191, 124815, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MargaretNet:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/> <br/>Anyway, if ever a true FREE study with no rules appears on the DPC I will be back, otherwise I will just check from time to time what you are all up to :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I can understand your desire to try something else but it would be great not to throw the baby with the bathwater.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by MargaretNet:  Anyway, if ever a true FREE study with no rules appears on the DPC I will be back, otherwise I will just check from time to time what you are all up to :)   I can understand your desire to try something else but it would be great not to throw the baby with the bathwater.', '2022-08-26 12:49:38.000000', NULL, 0),
